	(text "I2S master (main/tx.c):\nBCK = IO33   LRCLK = IO32   DIN = IO35   SCK/MCLK = IO0\nUART: TXD0/IO1 and RXD0/IO3\nEN RC + ESP_EN on pin 3; IO0 strap on pin 25.\nR8 10k pulls IO0 to +3V3 for normal boot.\nIO0 is shared with CP2102 auto-program and PCM1808 MCLK.\n\nANT1 = 2.4 GHz U.FL/IPEX pigtail (BOM only).\nMates to the 32U on-module U.FL. No GPIO, no PCB antenna."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
